      "mergedPostDetails": "im sure a lot of people have suggested this, but just in case, im sending this.\n\na cool feature could be if on the website or account settings, you could see your total playtime/hours. i get that you can see it on steamvr, but for oculus users, there's no way to see. im really curious about how much time i have because ive been on vrchat for nearly 3 years and have always been on quest, unless i am on desktop which is very rare for me, and i only have about 24 hours on there, so my vrchat hours would be much more. the curiosity is killing me, so please add this feature in the nearby future, thank you!!!\n\n- fazzy.",
